@node Display Requirements
@section Display

Source: FRN-NEED-001; decision 2 (DRM/KMS with fbdev fallback). Two render backends behind one trait; fbdev is the degraded path, never the first choice.

@anchor{FRN-SRS-001}
@subheading FRN-SRS-001 --- Draws through DRM/KMS at the preferred mode
@cindex FRN-SRS-001
@table @asis
@item Requirement
When a DRM device exposes a connected connector with at least one mode, the renderer shall draw through DRM/KMS using a dumb buffer at that connector's preferred mode.
@item Rationale
KMS is the only path that works before fbcon and with simpledrm.
