@anchor{FRN-SRS-032}
@subheading FRN-SRS-032 --- fairing.service hands the screen to greetd, holds last frame
@cindex FRN-SRS-032
@table @asis
@item Requirement
@code{fairing.service} shall be ordered @code{Before=greetd.service}, greetd's start shall stop @code{fairing.service} and wait for it to exit before greetd runs, and @code{fairing.service} shall hold DRM master and the last frame until it receives SIGTERM.
@item Rationale
systemd stops the splash at the exact moment the greeter starts. A @code{Conflicts=greetd.service} on the splash cannot do this: both units are wanted by the boot transaction, and systemd 255 resolves the conflicting jobs by deleting greetd's start (@code{systemd --test} on the unit pair, 2026-10-06), so greetd would never run. Amended in draft; for confirmation at G1.
@item Source
@ref{FRN-NEED-001}, decision 5.
@item Priority
mandatory
@item Verification
inspection
@item Status
draft
@item Milestone
M2
@end table

